    schema:alternateName "Yirrkala Community School Literature Production Centre" ;
    schema:description "The Literature Production Centre (LPC) has been part of the Yirrkala school since the 70's, and supports the Yolŋu Indigenous Languages and Culture program including, Yolŋu Matha, Galtha Rom and Garma Maths, as well as supporting Yolŋu teachers to deliver the school's bilingual program. " ;
    schema:name "Yirrkala Literature Production Centre" ;
